  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "0c8e4262-df81-18f9-8a04-c87adeeee697",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "fc9cdbbf-23e3-cf81-6d24-1f873719df76",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Now that the repository has been launched and linked directly from the AKU website, traffic is expected to rise even more. eCommons is very well indexed in Google, Google Scholar and other search engines.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "In the next phase of the project, a new interface called \"Selected Works\" will be installed. This will allow faculty and researchers at AKU to create personalised web profiles with links to their major publications.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Over time, conference papers, research reports, presentations and teaching materials will be added to the repository.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
